  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "§§ 373, 379, 381."
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "Act of June 20, 1939, chapter 224 (53 Stat. 843-844);"
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "8 U. S. C., Supp. V,"
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "§§ 382b, 382c."
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "Act of August 9, 1939, chapter 610 (53 Stat. 1273);"
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "Prior nationality"
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "status."
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "And any other Acts or parts of Acts in conflict with the provisions of"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "this Act, except for the purposes of section 346 of this Act."
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "The repeal herein provided shall not terminate nationality heretofore"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "lawfully acquired, nor restore nationality heretofore lost under any law"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "of the United States or any treaty to which the United States may have"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "been a party."
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "Separability clause."
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "SEC. 505. If any provision of this Act shall for any reason be declared"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "by any court of competent jurisdiction to be invalid, such declaration"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "shall not invalidate the remainder of this Act."
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "TITLE II"
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "Effective date."
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "SEC. 601. This Act shall take effect from and after ninety days from"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "the date of its approval."
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "Approved, October 14, 1940."
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "[CHAPTER 877]"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "AN ACT"
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "October 14, 1940"
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "[H. R. 10295]"
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "[Public, No. 854]"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "To amend the Act of June 23, 1938 (52 Stat. 944)."
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "Navy."
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "Promotion, etc., of"
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "officers."
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "Be it enacted by the Senate and House of Representatives of the"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "United States of America in Congress assembled, That the Act of"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "June 23, 1938 (52 Stat. 944), is hereby amended as follows:"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "Section 5, strike out subsection (a) and substitute the following:"
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "34 U. S. C., Supp."
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "V, § 292 (a)."
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "Selection boards."
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "Appointment, meet-"
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "ings, composition, etc."
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "\"(a) The board for the recommendation of line officers for promo-"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "tion to the grades of rear admiral and captain shall consist of nine"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "rear admirals on the active list of the line of the Navy, not restricted"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "by law to the performance of shore duty only. The board for the"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "recommendation of line officers for promotion to the grade of com-"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "mander shall consist of three rear admirals and six captains on the"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "active list of the line of the Navy, not restricted by law to the"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "performance of shore duty only. These boards shall be appointed"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "by the Secretary of the Navy and convened at least once each year"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "and at such times as the Secretary of the Navy may direct.\""
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "34 U. S. C., Supp."
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "V, §§ 295, 313."
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "Section 7, in subsections (a) and (b), strike out \"or who is not"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "physically qualified\"."
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "34 U. S. C., Supp."
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "V, § 294 (a)."
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "Section 8, in subsection (a), strike out \"other than medical\"."
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "34 U. S. C., Supp."
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "V, § 297 (e)."
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "Recommendations of"
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "line selection board."
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "Section 9, strike out subsection (f) and substitute the following:"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "\"(f) All reports or recommendations of a line selection board"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "under any provision of law shall require the concurrence of at least"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "two-thirds of the members.\""
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "34 U. S. C., Supp."
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "V, § 300 (b)."
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "Section 11, in subsection (b), at the end of the second proviso insert"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "\"with retired pay computed as provided in section 12 (b) of this"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "Act\"."
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "34 U. S. C., Supp."
  },
  {
   "role": "sidenote",
   "text": "V, § 404 (f)."
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "Section 12, subsection (f), in line 5 change \"from\" to \"to\", and"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "in line 6, after \"promoted\", insert \"computed as provided in subsec-"
  },
  {
   "role": "body",
   "text": "tion (b) of this section\"."
  }
 ],
